{bakery}<h2>{$name@current} / {$type@current}</h2>{batter@current optional}<p>Batter: @start@ {$batter@batter} {notLast} / {/notLast} @end@</p>{/batter@current} {topping@current optional}<p>Topping: @start@ {$topping@topping} {notLast} / {/notLast} @end@</p>{/topping@current} {filling@current optional}<p>Filling: @start@ {$name@*} {notLast} / {/notLast} @end@</p>{/filling@current} {/bakery}